  <p>Leave <strong>Show what the network covers</strong> on. It draws, in red, where the network's own buttons and caption sit over the picture, so the offer stays out of them. <strong>Checks</strong> then tells you whether the words are large enough to read on a phone.</p>

  <p>When a crop would cut into the product, render that shape instead: change <strong>Shape</strong> in the Image studio and run the prompt again.</p>

