  <p>The campaign you picked at the start already holds the clean renders. Add the edited copies from the Assets Library: tick their rows, pick the campaign and click <strong>Add to campaign</strong>. Nothing is copied; the campaign only points at the files.</p>

  <p>If the photos you have can't carry the season (a label too small, a range never shot), <a href="/services/design/ecommerce">the ecommerce design service</a> page describes how we produce the set in the studio. To make it yourself, <a href="/app/create">the create page of the app</a> shows the Image studio and the Skills catalog, and the <a href="/resources/how-to/product-photo-to-lifestyle-image">Product photo to lifestyle image</a> guide goes deeper on the edit.</p>

